  "notes": "Released as one collection of 8B, 70B and 405B models; the 8B and 70B are upgraded versions of the Meta Llama 3 sizes, the 405B is new. Hugging Face repositories were first named Meta-Llama-3.1-* and are now Llama-3.1-*; the old names redirect. Meta's paper The Llama 3 Herd of Models describes these models and calls them Llama 3 8B, 70B and 405B, so those short names are candidate aliases at most. Supported languages per the model card: English, German, French, Italian, Portuguese, Hindi, Spanish and Thai."
